# Painful Memory (jeuno 63): Mertaire in Lower Jeuno, the Waters of Oblivion in Ranguemont Pass. A level 40 bard with
# Path of the Bard completed: Mertaire's 138 (Progress, over Path of the Bard's Event 103; option 0: Option 1), a bone
# chip while offered (no trade handler: nil), 137
# (option 0: nothing; option 1: begun, Mertaire's Bracelet), 136; the Waters at Prog 0 with the bracelet (Tros popped,
# claimed; noAction), again with Tros up (the pop fails: still noAction), Tros's death (Prog 1), the Waters' 8 with a
# full bag (not completed) and with room (completed: Paper Knife, fame +7 x3, the bracelet deleted), the Waters
# completed (no section: WATERS_OF_OBLIVION), Mertaire completed (135).
lists LowerJeuno/Mertaire/onTrigger LowerJeuno/Mertaire/onTrade RanguemontPass/Waters_of_Oblivion/onTrigger RanguemontPass/Tros/onMobDeath LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/137 LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/138 RanguemontPass/onEventFinish/8
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-19.5,0,-59 job=BRD lvl=40
quest Jeuno.TheOldMonument completed
quest Jeuno.AMinstrelInDespair completed
quest Jeuno.PathOfTheBard completed
item BoneChip
login
trigger Mertaire                            # available, Option 0: 138
finish option=0                             # declined: Option 1
trade Mertaire BoneChip x1                  # available: no trade handler, nil
trigger Mertaire                            # Option 1: 137
finish option=0                             # not 1: nothing
trigger Mertaire                            # 137
finish option=1                             # begun: Mertaire's Bracelet
trigger Mertaire                            # accepted: 136 (Path of the Bard's arm: Painful Memory is not available)
finish
warp -289,-45,214 RanguemontPass
trigger Waters_of_Oblivion                  # Prog 0, the bracelet: Tros popped (claimed); noAction
trigger Waters_of_Oblivion                  # Tros up: the pop fails, noAction all the same
kill TROS                                   # Prog 1
trigger Waters_of_Oblivion                  # Prog 1: cutscene 8
fill-inventory
finish                                      # no room for the knife: not completed, the bracelet kept
free-inventory
trigger Waters_of_Oblivion                  # cutscene 8 again
finish                                      # completed: Paper Knife, fame +7 x3, the bracelet deleted
trigger Waters_of_Oblivion                  # completed: no section; WATERS_OF_OBLIVION
warp -19.5,0,-59 LowerJeuno
trigger Mertaire                            # completed: 135
finish
